[00:19.69]1.  Jehovah, the Maker of heaven,
[00:24.57]By heaven you can’t be contained,
[00:28.69]Even less an earthly dwelling place.
[00:33.53]But your spirit can here remain.
[00:38.89]Adorning this center of worship
[00:43.09]Are people who walk in your light.
[00:48.27]We rejoice to serve in unity;
[00:53.11]Our devotion is your delight.
[00:57.45](Bridge)
[00:57.57]There is nothing we have
[01:02.09]That you haven’t provided.
[01:07.03]From your own hand, we’ve given
[01:10.15]All that we offer you.
[01:16.51](Chorus)
[01:17.33]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[01:22.21]Our voices in song we now raise.
[01:26.35]For you’ve made our hope reality
[01:31.11]With this place that will bring you praise.
[01:38.95]2.  Jehovah, you knew that we wanted
[01:43.77]A place that will bring to you praise
[01:47.81]And will serve the needs of worshippers,
[01:52.89]Helping others to walk your ways.
[01:57.57]And now may this place serve your purpose.
[02:02.39]There’s work needing yet to be done,
[02:07.09]To pick up the pace and carry on
[02:12.07]In the work given by your Son.
[02:16.71](Bridge)
[02:16.83]So we offer the best
[02:21.03]Of our time and possessions.
[02:26.21]You alone are deserving—
[02:30.03]Giver of all good things.
[02:33.25](Chorus)
[02:33.25]For all you have done, we are grateful;
[02:33.27]Our voices in song we now raise.
[02:46.89]For you’ve made our hope reality
[02:51.23]With this place that will bring you praise.
